{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDIyL1RoZSUyMERheSUyMFRoZSUyME11c2ljJTIwRGllZCUyMEFtZXJpY2FuJTIwUGllJTIwJTI4MjAyMiUyOS8","type":"movie","name":"The Day The Music Died American Pie","description":"With a narrative running deeper than a catchy tune and cryptic verses, “American Pie” is a musical phenomenon woven deep into the history of American culture, entertaining audiences around the world for over 50 years. This documentary tells the stories of the people who were a part of this moment from the beginning, shows the point of view of a new generation of artists who are motivated by the same values and ideas that inspired the song’s creation, and highlights cultural moments in America’s history that are as relevant now as they were in 1971, when the song was released.\n\nRated PG · Released 8 Jul 2022 · United States · Language: English · 94 min\nStudio: Meteor 17, MTV Documentary Films\n\nOn your server — Audio: English · Subtitle files: English","releaseInfo":"2022","genres":["Documentary","Music","Hollywood"],"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/siWbXGJJpyjbwUMyt20LUap9bAF.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/owiZTTWx469NrKz98jOHpd4ckuu.jpg","imdbRating":"5.9","imdb_id":"tt12992162","moviedb_id":985709,"tmdbId":985709,"runtime":"94 min","cast":["Don McLean","Garth Brooks","Peter Gallagher","'Weird Al' Yankovic","Harvey Mason Jr.","Jade Bird","Jencarlos Canela","Maffio"],"director":["Mark Moormann"],"released":"2022-07-08T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"Do you believe in rock and roll?","country":"United States","language":"English","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Mark Moormann","character":"Director"},{"name":"Don McLean","character":"Self","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/8Z6nssdLUilFfrYUnUwmfFP5Gjr.jpg"},{"name":"Garth Brooks","character":"Self","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/7OkyIVEbqzCPQ5oS8nGWCpL7kWw.jpg"},{"name":"Peter Gallagher","character":"Self","photo":"https://image.tmdb.or